    "question": {
      "text": "Evaluate $\\displaystyle\\int_C (x^2+3yz)\\,ds$ where $C$ is the curve defined by $x=6y$, $z=4$ from $\\left(3,\\frac12,4\\right)$ to $(6,1,4)$.",
