      "text": "Evaluate the surface integral $\\displaystyle\\iint_S \\mathbf F\\cdot\\hat n\\,dA$, where $\\mathbf F=z^2\\mathbf i+xy\\mathbf j+y^2\\mathbf k$ and $S$ is the portion of the surface of the cylinder $x^2+y^2=49$; $0\\le z\\le5$ included in first octant.",
      "type": "MCQ",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "$518$"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
