    "answer": {
      "correctOption": "B",
      "correctText": "$512\\pi$",
      "explanation": "By the divergence theorem, $\\iint_S\\mathbf r\\cdot\\hat n\\,dA=\\iiint_V\\operatorname{div}\\mathbf r\\,dV$. Since $\\operatorname{div}\\mathbf r=2+3+1=6$ and the sphere has radius $4$, the volume is $\\frac43\\pi(4)^3$. Hence the integral is $6\\times\\frac43\\pi(4)^3=512\\pi$. Choice (B).",
      "status": "confirmed"
