      "explanation": "Put $x=3\\cos t$, $y=3\\sin t$, $z=0$, with $0\\le t\\le\\frac\\pi2$. Then $dx=-3\\sin t\\,dt$, $dy=3\\cos t\\,dt$. Therefore $\\int_C\\mathbf F\\cdot d\\mathbf r=-\\int_0^{\\pi/2}27\\sin^2t\\cos t\\,dt=-9$. Choice (C).",
